  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Global Partnership for Education 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GPE invests in building strong and resilient education systems in partner countries to equip children and youth with quality learning and teaching to foster effective transition into work life. It convenes a comprehensive set of stakeholders both at global and country levels (partner countries, donors, international organisations, development banks, civil society, foundations and the private sector). Stakeholders gather around a common set of principles and priorities that resonates well and help progress EU policy priorities, such as preparing education for green and digital transitions, quality learning and teaching, inequality and gender</narrative>
  </description>
